{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e6ae3c89-ce33-8d2c-be45-a08d0638b86e",
  "created_at": "2026-02-05T15:06:11-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Jose Ortiz",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T15:05:05-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T15:05:07-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, hello. I'm calling about a dip in the road, a sunken spot. Um, it's at 474 Van Zandt Avenue, in the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T15:05:14-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a dip. Is it a pothole or more of a settled area?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T15:05:18-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Settled. They dug a trench for a utility line, I think, and it filled in and then it sank. So now there's a dip, a low spot, right in front of the house. It's okay to call about that, right? It's something you handle?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T15:05:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, we handle that. Do you have photos by any chance?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T15:05:34-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do, yeah, I have photos on my phone. I can send them, whatever way you want. Sorry, I have to say, I'm about to take a long bath and the water's running, so I'm just keeping an eye on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T15:05:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. I'll note that photos are available, and someone can follow up for them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T15:05:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. Can you add the street to the repair list? Just so it's on there, so it gets fixed. Is that okay to ask?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T15:05:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, I'm adding Van Zandt Avenue now. Best number is the one you're calling from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T15:06:03-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0199."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T15:06:05-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Go enjoy your bath, and turn off that water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T15:06:09-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, yes, thank you. Bye."
    }
  ],
